##
    Recursion with no base case.

    This program compiles. Countdown never stops calling itself, because the test that would
    end it is missing. The failure names the cause rather than exhausting the stack.
##

shared model Program

    function Main()
        Console.WriteLine(Program.Countdown(10));
    end function

    # This should stop at zero, and does not.
    integer function Countdown(integer n)
        yield Program.Countdown(n - 1);
    end function

end model
